  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shelter and Non-food Items Emergency Assistance to Affected People in Batken Region of the Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project, IOM is providing humanitarian assistance to 1,680 of the most vulnerable internally displaced persons (IDPs) whose houses were destroyed by the escalation of violence in Batken oblast of Kyrgyzstan. Non-food items that are to be provided to 1,680 IDPs from Batken oblast, who are currently placed in temporary shelters and host families, are addressing urgent needs and include appropriate items for winterization: clothing and shoes, electric heating, and other items such as blankets/quilts, cooking utensils, bedding essentials.</narrative>
  </description>
